0%2C%22height%22%3A40%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22A%22%2C%22x%22%3A976%2C%22y%22%3A329%2C%22width%22%3A31%2C%22height%22%3A32%7D%5D%2C%22showTitle%22%3Afalse%2C%22title%22%3A%22%22%2C%22rotation%22%3A0%2C%22crop%22%3A%5B0%2C0%2C1%2C1%5D%2C%22averageHue%22%3A%22%23c4e2c3%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22u3631b3e4%22%2C%22margin%22%3A%7B%22top%22%3Atrue%2C%22bottom%22%3Atrue%7D%7D\"></card></p><p data-lake-id=\"uc8fe2e24\" id=\"uc8fe2e24\"><br></p><p data-lake-id=\"ua33b03bd\" id=\"ua33b03bd\"><span data-lake-id=\"u1b56170a\" id=\"u1b56170a\">编译器看到变量key_val没有地方修改，又要循环读，</span></p><p data-lake-id=\"u8b8e4f41\" id=\"u8b8e4f41\"><span data-lake-id=\"u093c77ca\" id=\"u093c77ca\">编译器可能就会进行优化，key_val的值存入CPU的寄存器中，而不去key_val的内存地址去反复读它；</span></p><p data-lake-id=\"u1da317c4\" id=\"u1da317c4\"><span data-lake-id=\"u6d4bf245\" id=\"u6d4bf245\">​</span><br></p><p data-lake-id=\"u8f88c2b2\" id=\"u8f88c2b2\"><span data-lake-id=\"u077d23c6\" id=\"u077d23c6\">假设b = key_val; 语句赋值前， 硬件修改了key_val值为1，那程序将出现错误；</span></p><card type=\"block\" name=\"hr\" value=\"data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22fpQlE%22%7D\"></card><h2 data-lake-id=\"WX24f\" id=\"WX24f\"><span data-lake-id=\"ud792b41b\" id=\"ud792b41b\">有volatile例子</span></h2><card type=\"inline\" name=\"codeblock\" value=\"data:%7B%22search%22%3A%22%22%2C%22mode%22%3A%22c%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%23include%20%3Cstdio.h%3E%5Cn%5Cn%2F%2F%20%E9%94%AE%E7%9B%98%E5%80%BC%EF%BC%8C%E7%A1%AC%E4%BB%B6%E4%BF%AE%E6%94%B9%5Cnvolatile%20int%20key_val%20%3D%2015%3B%5Cn%5Cnint%20main()%5Cn%7B%5Cn%5Ctint%20a%2C%20b%2C%20c%3B%5Cn%20%20%20%20%5Cn%20%20%20%20a%20%3D%20key_val%3B%5Cn%20%20%20%20b%20%3D%20key_val%3B%5Cn%20%20%20%20c%20%3D%20key_val%3B%5Cn%20%20%20%20%5Cn%5Ctreturn%200%3B%5Cn%7D%22%2C%22autoWrap%22%3Afalse%2C%22lineNumbers%22%3Atrue%2C%22heightLimit%22%3Atrue%2C%22collapsed%22%3Afalse%2C%22hideToolbar%22%3Afalse%2C%22name%22%3A%22%22%2C%22tabSize%22%3Anull%2C%22indentWithTab%22%3Afalse%2C%22lightLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22foldLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22theme%22%3A%22One%20Dark%20Pro%22%2C%22fontSize%22%3A14%2C%22customStyle%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22__spacing%22%3A%22both%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22jFwbu%22%2C%22margin%22%3A%7B%22top%22%3Atrue%2C%22bottom%22%3Atrue%7D%7D\"></card><p data-lake-id=\"u0ca7e1b7\" id=\"u0ca7e1b7\"><span data-lake-id=\"ua324d881\" id=\"ua324d881\">一旦有了volatile，就明确告诉编译器，key_val是反复无常的，你别优化，每次都老老实实检查下key_val的值；</span></p><p data-lake-id=\"ud7887122\" id=\"ud7887122\"><card type=\"inline\" name=\"image\" value=\"data:%7B%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F0%2F2024%2Fpng%2F43021193%2F1728556919662-c8192238-675e-477c-a9d0-d358b65bbb67.png%22%2C%22taskId%22%3A%22u19b31e76-cb6f-41e9-bbe7-da76d96cb66%22%2C%22clientId%22%3A%22uf6305484-c4ce-4%22%2C%22originalType%22%3A%22binary%22%2C%22width%22%3A924.8%2C%22height%22%3A518%2C%22linkTarget%22%3A%22_blank%22%2C%22name%22%3A%22image.png%22%2C%22size%22%3A77389%2C%22from%22%3A%22paste%22%2C%22originWidth%22%3A1156%2C%22originHeight%22%3A647%2C%22ratio%22%3A1.25%2C%22status%22%3A%22done%22%2C%22style%22%3A%22none%22%2C%22ocrLocations%22%3A%5B%7B%22text%22%3A%22%E5%86%85%E5%AD%98%E7%A9%BA%E9%97%B4%22%2C%22x%22%3A727%2C%22y%22%3A103%2C%22width%22%3A230%2C%22height%22%3A62%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22%E7%BC%96%E8%AF%91%E5%99%A8%E4%B8%8D%E4%BC%98%E5%8C%96%22%2C%22x%22%3A38%2C%22y%22%3A26%2C%22width%22%3A220%2C%22height%22%3A38%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22CPU%22%2C%22x%22%3A204%2C%22y%22%3A107%2C%22width%22%3A116%2C%22height%22%3A50%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22KEYVAL%22%2C%22x%22%3A982%2C%22y%22%3A223%2C%22width%22%3A141%2C%22height%22%3A39%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22%E5%AF%84%E5%AD%98%E5%99%A8%22%2C%22x%22%3A302%2C%22y%22%3A272%2C%22width%22%3A126%2C%22height%22%3A43%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22%E5%86%993%E6%AC%A1%22%2C%22x%22%3A553%2C%22y%22%3A538%2C%22width%22%3A94%2C%22height%22%3A39%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22%E8%AF%BB3%E6%AC%A1%22%2C%22x%22%3A553%2C%22y%22%3A203%2C%22width%22%3A94%2C%22height%22%3A37%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%2215%22%2C%22x%22%3A812%2C%22y%22%3A534%2C%22width%22%3A55%2C%22height%22%3A41%7D